    "detailed_description": "<h1>Our other games</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429090/extras/b7f501ef5f0c7820fec50e2764bd8b6b.avif?t=1697796915\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Step into the world of Garden Buddies and unleash your inner gardener. Cultivate a vibrant garden with adorable companion Mutsy, finding joy and peace. Nurture your virtual garden, overcome challenges, and celebrate achievements together. Garden Buddies invites you to a tranquil oasis, where creating brings calm and balance.</h2><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429090/extras/54907def682218001e0e5bdfa90c339b.webp?t=1697796915\" /></span><strong>Simple and Fun</strong><br><br>Simplicity reigns supreme in Garden Buddies, offering a chance to unwind and immerse yourself in soothing gameplay. The game's intuitive mechanics and user-friendly interface effortlessly guide your journey, encouraging relaxation and focusing on the captivating experience that awaits.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429090/extras/d077e52e85792e050624bfeac294ffa3.webp?t=1697796915\" /></span><strong>Friendship Is Key</strong><br><br>Companionship takes center stage as you embark on delightful encounters with adorable animals and extraordinary plant creatures every day. By forming a bond with these charming critters, you'll help them overcome hurdles through engaging and delightful mini-games. These challenges entertain and bring a sense of accomplishment and camaraderie.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429090/extras/7643ce456d65cd1f09b7de721e8d372b.webp?t=1697796915\" /></span><strong>Heal Your Mind</strong><br><br>Garden Buddies goes beyond the joy of gardening and mini-games, providing a healing experience for your mind and soul. Step away from the hustle and bustle of everyday life, take a deep breath, and let the game guide you toward inner peace.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429090/extras/c88815c04d92d60dfbed1f9d6ba5a1b0.webp?t=1697796915\" /></span><strong>Explore</strong><br><br>Explore essential life skills like box breathing and grounding techniques, while delving into emotions and engaging in discussions that promote emotional well-being. Garden Buddies becomes your virtual oasis, offering a safe haven to reduce stress and anxiety, all while immersing yourself in the beauty of digital nature.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429090/extras/6d23746a2cc94aa41cfcfc0e22a0518a.webp?t=1697796915\" /></span><strong>Escape to Tranquility</strong><br><br>Get ready to escape to a world where tranquility and companionship flourish. Let Garden Buddies be your guides as you cultivate not only a breathtaking flower garden but also a renewed sense of calm and balance in your life. Uncover the therapeutic power of gardening and embark on a journey of self-discovery and joy. Are you ready to find solace in the embrace of Garden Buddies? Your peaceful sanctuary awaits.<br><br><br><strong><i>Features:</i></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>90-minute story mode filled with enchanting narratives, heartwarming interactions, and unexpected twists.<br></li><li>Multiple Game Modes<br></li><li>A Soothing soundtrack made for relaxation and harmony<br></li><li>A healing experience for the mind, introducing essential life skills such as mindfulness exercises, stress reduction techniques, and emotional well-being practices<br></li><li>Charming characters and animal companions<br></li><li>Multiple customization options\u2013 unlock an array of decorative items and accessories for your oasis of peace and quiet.</li></ul>",
